* Module 4: Output Processor & Headphone Driver

VCC VCC 0 DC 12
VEE VEE 0 DC -12

* Input audio
VIN IN 0 SIN(0 2 1000)

* DC block
Cdc IN N1 10u
Rdc N1 0 100k

* Master volume pot (A100k) modeled as divider at mid
RV1 N1 W 50k
RV2 W 0 50k

* Line output buffer (low-Z)
Eline LINE 0 W 0 1
Rline LINE LOUT 100

* Headphone buffer (NE5532) driving 32 ohm
Ehp HP 0 W 0 1
Rhp HP HPOUT 10
RLhp HPOUT 0 32

* Decoupling
Cdec1 VCC 0 100n
Cdec2 VEE 0 100n

.control
.options reltol=1e-3 abstol=1e-9 vntol=1e-6 method=gear
tran 10u 50m uic
wrdata /tmp/output_headphone.cir.csv time HPOUT
print v(HPOUT)
.endc
.end